    "description": "Diamond import: top imports two arms that both import one shared leaf.\n\n    circuit ─┬─ left  (Nand) ─┐\n             └─ right (Nor)  ─┴─ leaf (Inv)\n\n`Inv` is reachable through two distinct import paths (via left and via\nright). Pins that the loader binds the shared module once by name and\nthat the diamond flattens — every Inv instance inlines the same NOT\n(shdl.md §9.1, AMB-27 program-global module identity).",
